{"step_index":136,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T07:28:41Z","input_tokens":20134,"cache_read_tokens":228514,"output_tokens":4228,"thinking":"Pipeline script generation is the next step. Need to ensure the script supports both clip-based and full-mode operations, incorporating an optional split mode for side-by-side comparisons as per the specified requirement. The script will be designed to handle the various modes correctly.\n\n\nThe existing script should be expanded to include the split-screen comparison, as the coordinator's note confirms its necessity. This means adapting the script to handle `--clips`, `--full`, and `--split` modes from the outset. The `--clips` mode requires checking for the existence of audio files, generating them if needed, and encoding the showcase clips with precise frame counts and audio parameters.\n\n\nThe script needs to handle the frame-specific arguments for each clip's ffmpeg command, integrating audio and video streams correctly. It will calculate start times and durations accurately to produce clips. The audio synthesis script is invoked to ensure the creation of the showcase's specific sound effects with precise timings and dimensional glitches.\n\n\nThe script will leverage the `rgbashift` filter within `ffmpeg` to create a visual glitch effect precisely synchronized with the audio glitches at the transitions between clips, specifically targeting frames 95-96 and 191-192. This effect is a dimensional tear. `--full` mode requires encoding a full video from the existing frames using `libx264` and the specified parameters. Audio will then be muxed in.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/bin/bash\n# V6 Spider-Verse Stylized Edition — Showcase Clips, Full Master & Split-Screen Muxer\n# 100% V5 Isolation: reads renders_v5/* read-only; writes ONLY to renders_v6/*.\n#\n# Usage:\n#   bash pipeline/mux_v6_sv.sh --clips   # Build 3x 4.0s showcase clips + 12.0s showcase reel\n#   bash pipeline/mux_v6_sv.sh --full    # Build full 2161-frame 90.04s V6 Spider-Verse master MP4s\n#   bash pipeline/mux_v6_sv.sh --split   # Build 90.04s V5 Photoreal vs V6 Spider-Verse 1080p split-screen MP4\nset -e\n\nMODE=\"${1:---clips}\"\nFF=/c/Users/86052/scoop/shims/ffmpeg.exe\nPY=$(command -v python || command -v python3)\nPROJ=\"D:/项目session/blender-supercar\"\n\nOUT_DIR=\"$PROJ/renders_v6\"\nSV_WAV=\"$OUT_DIR/sfx_spiderverse_90s.wav\"\nSV_MIX=\"$OUT_DIR/audio_v6_sv_mix_90s.m4a\"\nmkdir -p \"$OUT_DIR\"\n\n# Ensure V6 stylized 90.04s WAV & AAC 256k master mix exist\nif [ ! -f \"$SV_WAV\" ] || [ ! -f \"$SV_MIX\" ]; then\n  \"$PY\" \"$PROJ/pipeline/synth_sfx_sv.py\"\nfi\n\nif [ \"$MODE\" = \"--clips\" ]; then\n  C1_DIR=\"$OUT_DIR/clips_frames/clip1_miles_1610\"\n  C2_DIR=\"$OUT_DIR/clips_frames/clip2_gwen_65\"\n  C3_DIR=\"$OUT_DIR/clips_frames/clip3_2099_impact\"\n\n  C1_MP4=\"$OUT_DIR/clip1_miles_1610.mp4\"\n  C2_MP4=\"$OUT_DIR/clip2_gwen_65.mp4\"\n  C3_MP4=\"$OUT_DIR/clip3_2099_impact.mp4\"\n  REEL_MP4=\"$OUT_DIR/v6_spiderverse_showcase_12s.mp4\"\n\n  # 1) Clip 1 — Act I Earth-1610 Miles (f=61..156, ss=2.500s, dur=4.000s)\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y \\\n    -framerate 24 -start_number 61 -i \"$C1_DIR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n    -ss 2.500000 -t 4.000000 -i \"$SV_MIX\" \\\n    -frames:v 96 \\\n    -af \"afade=t=in:st=0:d=0.025,afade=t=out:st=3.955:d=0.045,alimiter=limit=0.81:attack=4:release=45:level=disabled\" \\\n    -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 17 -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n    -c:a aac -b:a 256k -ar 48000 -ac 2 -movflags +faststart \"$C1_MP4\"\n\n  # 2) Clip 2 — Act II Earth-65 Gwen Watercolor (f=1290..1385, ss=53.708333s, dur=4.000s)\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y \\\n    -framerate 24 -start_number 1290 -i \"$C2_DIR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n    -ss 53.708333 -t 4.000000 -i \"$SV_MIX\" \\\n    -frames:v 96 \\\n    -af \"afade=t=in:st=0:d=0.025,afade=t=out:st=3.955:d=0.045,alimiter=limit=0.81:attack=4:release=45:level=disabled\" \\\n    -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 17 -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n    -c:a aac -b:a 256k -ar 48000 -ac 2 -movflags +faststart \"$C2_MP4\"\n\n  # 3) Clip 3 — Act III Earth-928 2099 + f=1698..1699 Impact Slam (f=1650..1745, ss=68.708333s, dur=4.000s)\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y \\\n    -framerate 24 -start_number 1650 -i \"$C3_DIR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n    -ss 68.708333 -t 4.000000 -i \"$SV_MIX\" \\\n    -frames:v 96 \\\n    -af \"afade=t=in:st=0:d=0.025,afade=t=out:st=3.955:d=0.045,alimiter=limit=0.81:attack=4:release=45:level=disabled\" \\\n    -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 17 -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n    -c:a aac -b:a 256k -ar 48000 -ac 2 -movflags +faststart \"$REEL_MP4.tmp_c3.mp4\"\n  mv -f \"$REEL_MP4.tmp_c3.mp4\" \"$C3_MP4\"\n\n  # 4) 12.0s Showcase Reel (Clip 1 + Clip 2 + Clip 3 with 2-frame dimensional glitch micro-joins)\n  TMP_WAV=\"${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/v6_reel_12s_$$.wav\"\n  trap 'rm -f \"$TMP_WAV\"' EXIT\n  \"$PY\" \"$PROJ/pipeline/synth_sfx_sv.py\" --reel-wav \"$TMP_WAV\"\n\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y \\\n    -framerate 24 -start_number 61   -frames:v 96 -i \"$C1_DIR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n    -framerate 24 -start_number 1290 -frames:v 96 -i \"$C2_DIR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n    -framerate 24 -start_number 1650 -frames:v 96 -i \"$C3_DIR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n    -i \"$TMP_WAV\" \\\n    -filter_complex \"[0:v][1:v][2:v]concat=n=3:v=1:a=0,rgbashift=rh=-12:bh=12:rv=4:bv=-4:enable='between(n,95,96)+between(n,191,192)',fade=t=out:st=11.75:d=0.25[outv]\" \\\n    -map \"[outv]\" -map 3:a \\\n    -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 17 -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n    -c:a aac -b:a 256k -ar 48000 -ac 2 -movflags +faststart \"$REEL_MP4\"\n\n  rm -f \"$TMP_WAV\"\n  ls -la \"$C1_MP4\" \"$C2_MP4\" \"$C3_MP4\" \"$REEL_MP4\"\n\nelif [ \"$MODE\" = \"--full\" ]; then\n  FR_DIR=\"$OUT_DIR/frames\"\n  SILENT_MP4=\"$OUT_DIR/f1_silverstone_spiderverse_silent.mp4\"\n  FULL_MP4=\"$OUT_DIR/f1_silverstone_spiderverse_1080p.mp4\"\n\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -stats -y -framerate 24 -i \"$FR_DIR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n    -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 17 -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n    -movflags +faststart \"$SILENT_MP4\"\n\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$SILENT_MP4\" -i \"$SV_MIX\" \\\n    -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v copy -c:a copy -shortest \\\n    -movflags +faststart \"$FULL_MP4\"\n\n  ls -la \"$SILENT_MP4\" \"$FULL_MP4\"\n\nelif [ \"$MODE\" = \"--split\" ]; then\n  V5_SILENT=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_silent.mp4\"\n  V6_SILENT=\"$OUT_DIR/f1_silverstone_spiderverse_silent.mp4\"\n  SPLIT_MP4=\"$OUT_DIR/f1_silverstone_v5_vs_v6_split_1080p.mp4\"\n\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -stats -y \\\n    -i \"$V5_SILENT\" -i \"$V6_SILENT\" -i \"$SV_MIX\" \\\n    -filter_complex \"[0:v]crop=960:1080:480:0[left];[1:v]crop=960:1080:480:0[right];[left][right]hstack=inputs=2,drawbox=x=958:y=0:w=4:h=1080:color=white@0.92:t=fill[outv]\" \\\n    -map \"[outv]\" -map 2:a \\\n    -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 17 -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n    -c:a copy -shortest -movflags +faststart \"$SPLIT_MP4\"\n\n  ls -la \"$SPLIT_MP4\"\nelse\n  echo \"Unknown mode: $MODE (expected --clips, --full, or --split)\" >&2\n  exit 1\nfi\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\mux_v6_sv.sh"}}]}
